      "title": "Qt: Fix column widths resetting to minimum on profile switch",
      "message": "Qt: Fix column widths resetting to minimum on profile switch\n\nPacketListPane's duplicate header pair shown above the pinned-row\nstrip had every column's width silently reset to 0 by Qt's\nQHeaderView internals reacting to layoutChanged()/headerDataChanged()\non the shared packet list model, emitted by PacketListModel::resetColumns()\non every profile switch. forwardResize() then wrote that reset-to-0\nwidth back onto the real header, over writing the widths\napplyRecentColumnWidths() had just correctly applied from the new\nprofile's saved settings.\n\nGuard forwardResize() against forwarding a resize to width 0, since a\nreal user resize drag never produces one, and instead recover by\nre-asserting the real header's own current width back onto both\nduplicate headers.\n",
